    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="52">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 52</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif landagende man ætsace, þonne nemne man him his gelican ealswa micel wente swa cyninges þegne; gif him þæt berste, gilde lahsliht: VI healfmarc.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a landowner denies it, then as many compurgators, his equals, are to be nominated for him as for a king's thegn; if that fails, he is then to pay lahslit: 6 half-marks.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a landholder denies the charge, then just as many witnesses of his same status are to be chosen for him as for a king's thegn; if that fails then he is to pay lahslit: six half-marks.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
